D9ng t\u1EA1o URL tuy\u1EC7t \u0111\u1ED1i cho m\u1ED7i trang\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHreflang\u003C/strong\u003E: T\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng t\u1EA1o cho site \u0111a ng\u00F4n ng\u1EEF, bao g\u1ED3m x-default\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERobots Meta\u003C/strong\u003E: noindex/nofollow theo trang, m\u1EB7c \u0111\u1ECBnh max-image-preview:large\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJSON-LD\u003C/strong\u003E: T\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng t\u1EA1o schema WebSite, Organization, BreadcrumbList\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch3\u003ESitemap \u0026amp; Robots\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESitemap\u003C/strong\u003E: T\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng t\u1EA1o t\u1EA1i /sitemap.xml v\u1EDBi cache 30 ph\u00FAt\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERobots.txt\u003C/strong\u003E: T\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng t\u1EA1o t\u1EA1i /robots.txt v\u1EDBi ResponseCache(Duration=900)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFavicon\u003C/strong\u003E: L\u1EA5y t\u1EEB CMS settings, fallback /favicon.ico\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EError Pages\u003C/strong\u003E: HTTP status codes ch\u00EDnh x\u00E1c (404/500) qua UseStatusCodePagesWithReExecute\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch3\u003ECore Web Vitals\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECritical CSS inline\u003C/strong\u003E trong head \u0111\u1EC3 lo\u1EA1i b\u1ECF render-blocking\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELCP image preload\u003C/strong\u003E: link rel=preload v\u1EDBi fetchpriority=high\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGoogle Fonts async\u003C/strong\u003E: k\u1EF9 thu\u1EADt media=print onload\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFont preloading\u003C/strong\u003E: Font Awesome woff2\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EScripts on interaction/idle\u003C/strong\u003E: jQuery load sau t\u01B0\u01A1ng t\u00E1c \u0111\u1EA7u ti\u00EAn ho\u1EB7c 3s idle\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EImages lazy-loaded\u003C/strong\u003E: loading=lazy decoding=async cho \u1EA3nh below-the-fold\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EAccessibility (WCAG AA)\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EColor contrast: T\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 text \u0111\u1EA1t t\u1EC9 l\u1EC7 4.5:1 (AA)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECSS variables v\u1EDBi fallback an to\u00E0n cho text d\u1EC5 \u0111\u1ECDc\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EC\u1EA5u tr\u00FAc list \u0111\u00FAng: Mobile nav trong ul cho screen readers\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESemantic HTML: nav, main, section landmarks\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E"}}]}],"settingsData":[],"expose":[{"contentKey":"d1f20004-3001-4000-b004-000000000001","culture":"vi-VN","segment":null}],"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockList":[{"contentKey":"d1f20004-3001-4000-b004-000000000001","contentUdi":null,"settingsKey":null,"settingsUdi":null}]}}}]}],"settingsData":[{"contentTypeKey":"d8c525b6-c39b-47f9-9e7e-6cc60eae7a17","key":"d1f20004-4001-4000-b004-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"addStyleSpacing","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":["Remove Spacing"]}]},{"contentTypeKey":"d8c525b6-c39b-47f9-9e7e-6cc60eae7a17","key":"d1f20004-5001-4000-b004-000000000001","values":[]}],"expose":[{"contentKey":"d1f20004-1001-4000-b004-000000000001","culture":"vi-VN","segment":null},{"contentKey":"d1f20004-2001-4000-b004-000000000001","culture":"vi-VN","segment":null}],"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"areas":[{"items":[{"areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"contentKey":"d1f20004-2001-4000-b004-000000000001","contentUdi":null,"rowSpan":1,"settingsKey":"d1f20004-5001-4000-b004-000000000001","settingsUdi":null}],"key":"74341b8e-afe1-47c5-bd24-d94b157e8a1c"}],"columnSpan":12,"contentKey":"d1f20004-1001-4000-b004-000000000001","contentUdi":null,"rowSpan":1,"settingsKey":"d1f20004-4001-4000-b004-000000000001","settingsUdi":null}]}}]]></Value>
